      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "GLP-1 physiology enabled an exceptionally consequential therapeutic advance for diabetes and obesity.",
        "attribution": "Holst, Mojsov, and Drucker provide a coherent three-person account of core physiological discovery and its translation.",
        "maturity": "The biological mechanism and broad clinical benefit are mature and extensively established.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The contribution of drug-development leadership, including Lotte Bjerre Knudsen, creates a difficult but important attribution boundary."
